{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 29, :comments ["<b>And who would give that all the people of HaShem were prophets.</b> Whether in the camp or in the Tent of Meeting — to lighten the burden from upon me." "<b>When HaShem puts His spirit upon them.</b> And not from my spirit. For what the Holy One, blessed be He, said, to put from my spirit — that refers only to the seventy elders, but no more do they prophesy from my spirit, but rather from the spirit of the Holy One, blessed be He. Would that they were all prophesying in this manner."], :book :numbers, :voice :chizkuni, :lang :en, :chapter 11, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T15:17:34.000409386Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}